<h1>Portfolio SEO Status Report</h1>

<p class="meta">
  <strong>Site:</strong> https://kunalkhandelwal.dev<br>
  <strong>Owner:</strong> Kunal Khandelwal<br>
  <strong>Stack:</strong> Next.js App Router<br>
  <strong>Report date:</strong> August 8, 2026<br>
  <strong>Overall SEO health:</strong> Strong (production-ready foundation)
</p>

<div class="verdict">
  <strong>Verdict:</strong> Core technical SEO is in place. Remaining gains come from content volume,
  dedicated OG images, Search Console monitoring, and structured-data enhancements (BreadcrumbList / ItemList).
</div>

<h2>1. Executive Summary</h2>

<table>
