<h2>5. Dynamic Project Case Studies (/works/[id])</h2>

<p><strong>Content:</strong> <code>content/projects/*.mdx</code><br>
<strong>Helpers:</strong> <code>project.ts</code>, <code>project-seo.ts</code><br>
<strong>Metadata:</strong> <code>generateMetadata</code> in works/[id]/layout.tsx<br>
<strong>JSON-LD:</strong> CreativeWork on project detail pages</p>

<h3>Frontmatter contract</h3>
<pre>title, slug, category, description, client, website, image, stack</pre>

<h3>Generated fields</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Field</th><th>Behavior</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Title</td><td>{Project Title} | Kunal Khandelwal</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Description</td><td>frontmatter.description</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Canonical</td><td>https://kunalkhandelwal.dev/works/{slug}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Robots</td><td>index: true, follow: true</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Open Graph</td><td>article + images</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Twitter</td><td>summary_large_image</td></tr>
  <tr><td>JSON-LD</td><td>CreativeWork</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Indexed case studies (4)</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Slug</th><th>Title</th><th>Category</th><th>Image</th></tr>
  <tr><td>admatrica</td><td>Admatrica</td><td>Freelance</td><td>/images/works/admatrica.png</td></tr>
  <tr><td>arabazaar</td><td>AraBazaar</td><td>Founding Engineer</td><td>/images/works/arabazaar.png</td></tr>
